e contracts just under the limit are spread across 35 different awardees. Contract [1], for 39,704.89 euros, was awarded in November 2025.\nWhat it cannot show: The fact that many contracts are just under the limit does not prove improper actions. It could reflect market prices, budget constraints, or separate needs. Statistical indicators alone do not indicate wrongdoing without further investigation.\nWhat can be checked: Check the details of contract [1] to see what was purchased and the dates. Verify if multiple contracts cover the same need. Review if the same awardee was used repeatedly for similar services.","origen_es":"modelo","origen_en":"modelo","modelo":"Qwen3-4B (Q4_K_M, llama.cpp)","regla":"obras","citas":["fg3fIx21DtRxseVhcqrkhw%3D%3D","G63JO08BqsacTfjQf3USOg%3D%3D","sbkVzHeh1dOS81gZFETWmA%3D%3D"],"generado":"2026-11-15"}}